.Dd September 4, 2026
.Dt MAC_ABACD 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_abacd
.Nd load and maintain MAC ABAC policy rules
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl dfv
.Op Fl c Ar config
.Op Fl p Ar pidfile
.Nm
.Fl t
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl c Ar config
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
loads an attribute-based access-control policy into the
.Xr mac_abac 4
kernel module.
The default configuration file is
.Pa /etc/mac_abac.conf .
On receipt of
.Dv SIGHUP ,
the daemon reloads the configuration.
.Pp
The rc service is disabled by default because loading an enforcing policy can
restrict system access.
The
.Xr mac_abac 4
policy must be compiled into the kernel or loaded during boot before this
service is started.
After reviewing the policy, enable it with
.Bd -literal -offset indent
sysrc mac_abacd_enable=YES
service mac_abacd start
.Ed
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl c Ar config
Use the specified UCL or JSON policy file.
.It Fl d
Do not detach from the controlling terminal.
.It Fl f
Run in the foreground.
.It Fl p Ar pidfile
Write the process ID to
.Ar pidfile .
.It Fl t
Validate the configuration without changing kernel policy.
.It Fl v
Increase diagnostic output.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/mac_abac.conf
.It Pa /etc/mac_abac.conf
Default policy configuration.
.It Pa /etc/rc.d/mac_abacd
Service control script.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_abac 4 ,
.Xr mac_abac.conf 5 ,
.Xr mac_abac_ctl 8
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
was added in
.Dx 16.0 .
